# --- Research: deliberately NOT published ---
# This repository is public. The litepaper and technical notes are held back
# pending a disclosure decision; they live only on local disk and are not
# backed up by this remote. Remove these entries to publish them.
#
# The leading slash anchors this to the repository root. Without it, a bare
# `silo` also matches contracts/src/silo/storage/, which is source and must
# stay tracked.
/silo/
index.md

# Bucket decision records cite the reference implementations at source level and
# are held back on the same basis as the technical notes.
contracts/DECISIONS.md

# Reference implementations are read-only third-party sources kept outside this
# repository. Entry is defensive, in case a copy is ever placed inside it.
/reference/

